        ///     @param inShapeFilter Filter that is used to check if a character collides with a subshape.
        ///   </code>
        ///   <para>
        ///     Collects every hit into checkcollisionresults, which you allocate and size. Returns how many were
        ///     written; totalHits is how many the query found, so a larger span is needed when it exceeds the span's
        ///     length.
        ///   </para>
        ///   <para>
        ///     Pass default for broadPhaseLayerFilter to filter nothing out.
        ///   </para>
        ///   <para>
        ///     Pass default for objectLayerFilter to filter nothing out.
        ///   </para>
        ///   <para>
